# --- uses: ["core"] injects multiple builtins from the core module.
# This test verifies that multiple distinct core builtins are accessible
# in a document that declares --- uses: ["core"]: both arithmetic (builtin-add)
# and comparison (builtin-lt) work, demonstrating the full module injection.
--- uses: ["core"]
[add_result: [builtin-add 3 4]  cmp_result: [builtin-lt 1 2]]
=== out
Dict({"add_result": Int(7), "cmp_result": Bool(true)})
